      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://huntingdonhistory.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 1854 McMurtrie House now houses the Huntingdon County Historical Society offices and a Victorian museum.",
